{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demonic possessions are increasing all over the land. You are a priest being trained by the church to perform exorcisms. Equipped with your exorcism book and a case of Holy Relics you are sent to aid the afflicted population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to surrounding villages and stop the Seven Demonic Forces before they claim more souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore evil infested areas, investigate the source of corruption and find lost relics to help in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in Church rituals that are essential to fight the demonic invasion and use your newly gained knowledge to decide how the story ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Our help is in the name of the Lord.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More info and demo coming soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691430?t=1745662040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/0c5094fed122a66eafa0dbf1a4f1d0c640a43c6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745662040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/c8169a02dd7d7e2dcd00ad0ecd2da437df0046c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745662040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/c8169a02dd7d7e2dcd00ad0ecd2da437df0046c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745662040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Bodily harm on adults done by demons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demonic possessions are increasing all over the land. You are a priest being trained by the church to perform exorcisms. Equipped with your exorcism book and a case of Holy Relics you are sent to aid the afflicted population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to surrounding villages and stop the Seven Demonic Forces before they claim more souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore evil infested areas, investigate the source of corruption and find lost relics to help in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in Church rituals that are essential to fight the demonic invasion and use your newly gained knowledge to decide how the story ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Our help is in the name of the Lord.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More info and demo coming soon.</p>","developers":["Tusks And Talons Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/c674b0a5368aff5264f879d4cbb203227d0b7a64/header.jpg?t=1745662040","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Video Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131243,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131243/movie480.mp4?t=1745662039","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131243/movie_max.mp4?t=1745662039"},"name":"Gameplay Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131243/f265e3de8188a63ccd19d5e7b0f07e4997fd7ef6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745662039","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131243/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745662039","